# The stack ships with a STUB model wired in, so `ai` / `reuse` / `recovery`
# are all demonstrable with no key and no bill. The stub returns canned
# verdicts and reports itself as `stub-4o-mini` — it is not a model.
#
# To use a real one, uncomment and fill in. That replaces the stub entirely.
#
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_API_KEY=sk-...
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_PRICE_IN_PER_1K=0.00015
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_PRICE_OUT_PER_1K=0.0006
#
# To see the rule floor instead (what happens when the model is unreachable),
# set the base URL to an empty value:
# HOOKJUDGE_AI_BASE_URL=
#
# Where your hookrelay checkout lives, if not a sibling of this repo.
# HOOKRELAY_PATH=../../../hookrelay
